(text "Stop, isolate all supplies and verify de-energized before exchanging plugs. Use a captive, keyed, touch-protected assembly rated for the verified control circuit." (at 17.78 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5972 1.5972)) (justify left)) (uuid "dc8be9c5-eef3-5325-95ad-3cbb2a30e1ec"))
(text "Prove that restoring power or resetting a trip with START held cannot restart the motor. A conventional holding circuit alone does not enforce release-before-restart." (at 17.78 240.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.5972 1.5972)) (justify left)) (uuid "0ed18787-4000-51a3-bd51-a7d56f196406"))
(text "Only the controller permission is returned by P2. Keep every required STOP and protection in the independent starter loop. Do not transfer a running pump." (at 17.78 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.5972 1.5972)) (justify left)) (uuid "6926c19d-f7a2-54ef-a9b6-3ebc24994c3a"))
(text "Cavity numbers apply to this adapter only. Electronic keypad starters require a separate, manufacturer-supported interface and shutdown assessment." (at 17.78 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1.5972 1.5972)) (justify left)) (uuid "4c2212d5-2cee-50c6-8e2a-2db478213171"))
